#: ../data/org.debian.apt.policy.in.h:1
msgid "List keys of trusted vendors"
msgstr "Mifteyên firoşkarên ewledar rêz bike"

#: ../data/org.debian.apt.policy.in.h:2
msgid "To view the list of trusted keys, you need to authenticate."
msgstr ""
"Ji bo dîtina lîsteyên mifteyan ên pêbawer divê hûn nasnameyê piştrast bikin."

#: ../data/org.debian.apt.policy.in.h:3 ../aptdaemon/console.py:619
msgid "Remove downloaded package files"
msgstr "Peldankên pakêtan yên daxistî rakin"

#: ../data/org.debian.apt.policy.in.h:4
msgid "To clean downloaded package files, you need to authenticate."
msgstr ""
"Ji bo paqijkirina peldankên pakêtan ên daxistî divê hûn nasnameyê piştrast "
"bikin."

#: ../data/org.debian.apt.policy.in.h:5
msgid "Change software configuration"
msgstr "Mîhengên nivîsbariyê biguherînin"

#: ../data/org.debian.apt.policy.in.h:6
msgid "To change software settings, you need to authenticate."
msgstr ""
"Ji bo guherandina mîhengên nivîsbariyê divê hûn nasnameyê piştrast bikin."

#: ../data/org.debian.apt.policy.in.h:7
msgid "Change software repository"
msgstr "Depoya nivîsbariyê biguherînin"

#: ../data/org.debian.apt.policy.in.h:8
msgid "To change software repository settings, you need to authenticate."
msgstr ""
"Ji bo guherîna mîhengên depoya nivîsbariyê, divê tu nasnameya xwe piştrast "
"bikî."

#: ../data/org.debian.apt.policy.in.h:9
msgid "Install package file"
msgstr "Peldanka pakêtê saz bikin"

#: ../data/org.debian.apt.policy.in.h:10
msgid "To install this package, you need to authenticate."
msgstr "Ji bosazkirina peldanka pakêtê divê hûn nasnameyê piştrast bikin."

#: ../data/org.debian.apt.policy.in.h:11
msgid "Update package information"
msgstr "Agahiya pakêtan rojane bike"

#: ../data/org.debian.apt.policy.in.h:12
msgid "To update the software catalog, you need to authenticate."
msgstr ""
"Ji bo rojanekirina kataloga nivîsbariyê divê hûn nasnameyê piştrast bikin."

#: ../data/org.debian.apt.policy.in.h:13
msgid "Install or remove packages"
msgstr "Pakêtan saz bikin an jî rakin"

#: ../data/org.debian.apt.policy.in.h:14
msgid "To install or remove software, you need to authenticate."
msgstr ""
"Ji bo sazkirin an jî rakirina nivîsbariyê divê hûn nasnameyê piştrast bikin."

#. This priviledge will be requested when installing a package
#. from a high trusted repository that can be explicitely whitelisted.
#. 
#. The defaults for this action are the same as
#. "org.debian.apt.install-or-remove-packages".
#. 
#. The admin can override them to e.g. allow passwordless installs for
#. leightweight applications like unity-webapps or for packages
#. comming from high trust repositories (like internal repositories)
#. 
#: ../data/org.debian.apt.policy.in.h:25
msgid "Install software from a high-trust whitelisted repository."
msgstr ""
"Nivîsbariyê ji depoyeke pir ewledar a ku heke di  lîsteya spî de be, saz "
"bikin"

#: ../data/org.debian.apt.policy.in.h:26
msgid "To install software, you need to authenticate."
msgstr "Ji bo sazkirinê nivîsbarîyê rastandina nasnameyê pêdivîye."

#. This privilege allows to call AddRepository, UpdateCache(Partially)
#. and InstallPackages in a row and only authenticating once.
#. 
#. The client has to authenticate for this privilege before calling
#. the aptdaemon methods.
#: ../data/org.debian.apt.policy.in.h:32
msgid "Add a new repository and install packages from it"
msgstr "Depoyeke nû saz bikin û pakêtan ji wê saz bikin."

#: ../data/org.debian.apt.policy.in.h:33
msgid "To install software from a new source, you need to authenticate."
msgstr ""
"Ji bo sazkirina nivîsbariyê ji depeoyeke nû divê hûn nasnameyê piştrast "
"bikin."

#. This privilege allows to call AddRepository, UpdateCache(Partially)
#. and InstallPackages in a row and only authenticating once.
#. 
#. The client has to authenticate for this privilege before calling
#. the aptdaemon methods.
#. 
#. The only difference to install-packages-from-new-repo is the wording
#. of the message. It is required by Ubuntu's Software-Center.
#: ../data/org.debian.apt.policy.in.h:42
msgid ""
"Add a new repository of purchased software and install packages from it"
msgstr ""
"Depoya nû ya nivîsbariyê ya hatiye kirîn tevlî bikin û ji wê pakêtan saz "
"bikin."

#: ../data/org.debian.apt.policy.in.h:43
msgid "To install purchased software, you need to authenticate."
msgstr ""
"Ji bo sazkirina nivîsbariyê ya hatiye kirîn divê hûn nasnameyê piştrast "
"bikin."

#: ../data/org.debian.apt.policy.in.h:44
msgid "Upgrade packages"
msgstr "Pakêtan bilind bike"

#: ../data/org.debian.apt.policy.in.h:45
msgid "To install updated software, you need to authenticate."
msgstr ""
"Ji bo sazkirina nivîsbariyê ya rojanekirî divê hûn nasnameyê piştrast bikin."

#: ../data/org.debian.apt.policy.in.h:46
msgid "Cancel the task of another user"
msgstr "Peywira bikarhênereke din betal bike"

#: ../data/org.debian.apt.policy.in.h:47
msgid "To cancel someone else's software changes, you need to authenticate."
msgstr ""
"Ji bo betalkirina guhertinên bikarhênereke din divê hûn nasnameyê piştrast "
"bikin."

#: ../data/org.debian.apt.policy.in.h:48
msgid "Set a proxy for software downloads"
msgstr "Ji bo sazkirina nivîsbariyan proxy-yê eyar bikin"

#: ../data/org.debian.apt.policy.in.h:49
msgid ""
"To use a proxy server for downloading software, you need to authenticate."
msgstr ""
"Ji bo bikaranînan proxy-yê bo sazkirina nivîsbariyê divê hûn nasnameyê "
"piştrast bikin."

#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:215
msgid "ERROR"
msgstr "ÇEWTÎ"

#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:249
#, python-format
msgid "Downloaded %(cur)sB of %(total)sB at %(rate)sB/s"
msgstr "%(cur)sB -a %(total)sB -ê ji %(rate)sB/s hat daxistin."

#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:255
#, python-format
msgid "Downloaded %(cur)sB of %(total)sB"
msgstr "%(cur)sB -a %(total)sB -ê hat daxistin."

#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:385 ../aptdaemon/console.py:390
msgid "ERROR:"
msgstr "ÇEWTÎ"

#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:386
msgid "You are not allowed to perform this action."
msgstr "Destûra we ya ji bo pêkanîna vê çalakiyê tune ye."

#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:409 ../aptdaemon/console.py:537
msgid "Queuing"
msgstr "Terîk"

#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:417 ../aptdaemon/enums.py:527
msgid "Resolving dependencies"
msgstr "Çareserkirina bestekiyan"

#. TRANSLATORS: %s is the number of packages
#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:459
#, python-format
msgid "The following NEW package will be installed (%(count)s):"
msgid_plural "The following NEW packages will be installed (%(count)s):"
msgstr[0] "Pakêta nû ya jêr dê bê sazkirin (%(count)s):"
msgstr[1] "Pakêtên nû ya jêr dê bên sazkirin (%(count)s):"

#. TRANSLATORS: %s is the number of packages
#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:467
#, python-format
msgid "The following package will be upgraded (%(count)s):"
msgid_plural "The following packages will be upgraded (%(count)s):"
msgstr[0] "Pakêta jêr dê bê bilindkirin (%(count)s):"
msgstr[1] "Pakêtên jêr dê bên bilinkirin (%(count)s):"

#. TRANSLATORS: %s is the number of packages
#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:475
#, python-format
msgid "The following package will be REMOVED (%(count)s):"
msgid_plural "The following packages will be REMOVED (%(count)s):"
msgstr[0] "Pakêta jêr dê bê DERXISTIN (%(count)s):"
msgstr[1] "Pakêtên jêr dê bên DERXISTIN (%(count)s):"

#. TRANSLATORS: %s is the number of packages
#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:484
#, python-format
msgid "The following package will be DOWNGRADED (%(count)s):"
msgid_plural "The following packages will be DOWNGRADED (%(count)s):"
msgstr[0] "Pakêta jêr dê bê NIZMKIRIN (%(count)s):"
msgstr[1] "Pakêtên jêr dê bên NIZMKIRIN (%(count)s):"

#. TRANSLATORS: %s is the number of packages
#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:492
#, python-format
msgid "The following package will be reinstalled (%(count)s):"
msgid_plural "The following packages will be reinstalled (%(count)s):"
msgstr[0] "Pakêta jêr dê dîsa bê SAZKIRIN (%(count)s):"
msgstr[1] "Pakêtên jêr dê dîsa bên SAZKIRIN (%(count)s):"

#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:499
#, python-format
msgid "The following package has been kept back (%(count)s):"
msgid_plural "The following packages have been kept back (%(count)s):"
msgstr[0] "Pakêta jêr şûnve hat stendin (%(count)s):"
msgstr[1] "Pakêtên jêr şûnve hatin stendin (%(count)s):"

#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:507
#, python-format
msgid "Need to get %sB of archives."
msgstr "Divê %sB -a arşîvan bê(n) stendin."

#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:510
#, python-format
msgid "After this operation, %sB of additional disk space will be used."
msgstr "Piştî vê karê, dê %sB cihê zêdek a dîskê  bê(n) bikaranîn."

#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:514
#, python-format
msgid "After this operation, %sB of additional disk space will be freed."
msgstr "Piştî vê karê, dê %sB cihê zêdek a dîskê  bê(n) valakirin."

#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:522 ../aptdaemon/console.py:524
msgid "Do you want to continue [Y/n]?"
msgstr "Hûn dixwazin dewam bikin [E/n]?"

#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:545
msgid ""
"To operate on more than one package put the package names in quotation "
"marks:\n"
"aptdcon --install \"foo bar\""
msgstr ""
"Ji bo li ser gelek pakêtan kar bikin, navên pakêtan têxin nav nîşaneka "
"dunikê:\n"
"aptdcon --install \"foo bar\""

#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:551
msgid "Refresh the cache"
msgstr "Pêşbîrgehê nû bike"

#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:554
msgid ""
"Try to resolve broken dependencies. Potentially dangerous operation since it "
"could try to remove many packages."
msgstr ""
"Xîret bikin ku bestekiyên şkestî çareser bikin. Ji ber potansîyelê ev kar "
"xeternak e, mimkun e ku bixwaze gelek pakêtan derxe."

#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:559
msgid "Try to finish a previous incompleted installation"
msgstr "Xîret bikin ku sazkirina berê ya netemamkirî xelas bibe."

#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:563 ../aptdaemon/console.py:576
msgid "Install the given packages"
msgstr "pelên ku tên dayîn sazbike"

#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:566
msgid "Reinstall the given packages"
msgstr "Pelên ku tên dayîn dîsa saz bike"

#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:569
msgid "Remove the given packages"
msgstr "Pelên ku tên dayîn rake"

#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:572
msgid "Remove the given packages including configuration files"
msgstr "Pelên eyarkirinê tê de pelên ku tên dayîn rake"

#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:579
msgid "Downgrade the given packages"
msgstr "Pelên ku tên dayîn nizm bike"

#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:582
msgid "Deprecated: Please use --safe-upgrade"
msgstr "Nepejirandî: Ji kerema xwe bilindkirina ewledar bi kar bîne"

#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:586
msgid "Upgrade the system in a safe way"
msgstr "Pergalê bi riyekî ewledar bilind bike"

#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:589
msgid "Upgrade the system, possibly installing and removing packages"
msgstr "Pergalê, pakêtên sazkirin û rakirinê yên mihtemel bilind bike"

#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:593
msgid "Add the vendor to the trusted ones"
msgstr "Firoşkar tevlî yên ewledar bike"

#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:596
msgid "Add the vendor keyid (also needs --keyserver)"
msgstr "Mifteya firoşkar tevlî bike (mifteya rajekarê jî divê)"

#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:600
msgid "Use the given keyserver for looking up keys"
msgstr "Ji bo lêgerîna mifteyan rajekara bingehîn bi kar bîne"

#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:604
msgid "Add new repository from the given deb-line"
msgstr "Ji deb-line-ê ku hatiye dayîn, depeyoke nû tevlî bike"

#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:608
msgid ""
"Specify an alternative sources.list.d file to which repositories should be "
"added."
msgstr ""
"Peleke alternatîf a sources.list.d diyar bike bo tevlîkirina depoyan."

#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:612
msgid "List trusted vendor keys"
msgstr "Mifteyên firoşkarên ewledar rêz bike"

#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:615
msgid "Remove the trusted key of the given fingerprint"
msgstr "Mifteya ewledar a şopa tiliyê ya ku hatiye dayîn, rake"

#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:622
msgid ""
"Reconfigure installed packages. Optionally the minimum priority of questions "
"can be specified"
msgstr ""
"Pakêtên sazkirî dîsa eyar bike. Li gorî daxwazê, mimkun e ku pêşaniya "
"kêmtirîn a pirsan diyar bibe."

#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:627
msgid "The minimum debconf priority of question to be displayed"
msgstr "Pêşaniya debconf a kêmtirîn a pirsên ku dê were diyarkirin"

#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:631
msgid "Do not attach to the apt terminal"
msgstr "Li termînala apt-ê pêve neke"

#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:635
msgid "Allow packages from unauthenticated sources"
msgstr "Destûrê bide ji pakêtên nepiştrastkirî re"

#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:639
msgid ""
"Show additional information about the packages. Currently only the version "
"number"
msgstr ""
"Di derbarê pakêtan de agahiyên zêdek nîşan bide. Niha tenê hejmara guhertoyê"

#: ../aptdaemon/console.py:647 ../aptdaemon/enums.py:532
msgid "Waiting for authentication"
msgstr "Li benda piştrastkirina nasnameyê ye"

#: ../aptdaemon/core.py:2148
msgid "Do not shutdown the daemon because of inactivity"
msgstr "Ji ber bêtevgeriyê deamon-ê negire"

#: ../aptdaemon/core.py:2153
msgid "Do not load any plugins"
msgstr "Tu pêvekeke lê bar neke"

#: ../aptdaemon/core.py:2157
msgid "Show internal processing information"
msgstr "Agahiyên karên hundirî nîşan bide"

#: ../aptdaemon/core.py:2162
msgid "Quit and replace an already running daemon"
msgstr "Deamoneke ya jixwe dixebite, bigire û biguherîne"

#: ../aptdaemon/core.py:2167
msgid "Listen on the DBus session bus (Only required for testing"
msgstr "Ji ser riya daneyan ya DBus guhdarî bike (Tenê ji bo testê hewce ye"

#: ../aptdaemon/core.py:2171
msgid "Perform operations in the given chroot"
msgstr "Karên hatine dayîn ên ku li chroot-ê ne, pêk bînin"

#: ../aptdaemon/core.py:2176
msgid "Store profile stats in the specified file"
msgstr "Statîstîkên profîlê li nav peldankê diyarkirî depo bike"

#: ../aptdaemon/core.py:2181
msgid "Do not make any changes to the system (Only of use to developers)"
msgstr ""
"Li nav pergalê guhertineke çênekin (Tenê ji bo pêşdebiran bi kar bînin)"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:337
msgid "Installed file"
msgstr "Peldanka sazbûyî"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:338
msgid "Installed packages"
msgstr "Pakêtên sazbûyî"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:339
msgid "Added key from file"
msgstr "Mifteha tevlîbûyî ya ji peldankê"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:340
msgid "Updated cache"
msgstr "Pêşbîr hate rojanekirin"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:341
msgid "Search done"
msgstr "Lêgerîn qediya"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:342
msgid "Removed trusted key"
msgstr "Mifteya ewledat hat rakirin"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:343
msgid "Removed packages"
msgstr "Pakêtên rakirî"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:344
msgid "Updated packages"
msgstr "Pakêt hatin rojanekirin"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:345
msgid "Upgraded system"
msgstr "Pergal hate bilindkirin"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:346
msgid "Applied changes"
msgstr "Guhartin bi kêr hat"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:347
msgid "Repaired incomplete installation"
msgstr "Sazkirina netemamkirî hat temîrkirin"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:348
msgid "Repaired broken dependencies"
msgstr "Bestekiyên şekstî hat temîrkirin"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:349
msgid "Added software source"
msgstr "Çavkaniya nivîsbariyê hat tevlîkirin."

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:350
msgid "Enabled component of the distribution"
msgstr "Hêmana reşaneyê tê çalakkirin"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:351
msgid "Removed downloaded package files"
msgstr "Pakêtên peldankan ên daxistî hat rakirin"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:352
msgid "Reconfigured installed packages"
msgstr "Pakêtên ku dîsa hatine eyarkirin, hatin sazkirin."

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:356
msgid "Successful"
msgstr "Serkeftî"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:357
msgid "Canceled"
msgstr "Hat betalkirin"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:358 ../aptdaemon/enums.py:569
msgid "Failed"
msgstr "Biserneket"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:361
msgid "Installing file"
msgstr "Pel tê sazkirin"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:362
msgid "Installing packages"
msgstr "Pakêt tê sazkirin"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:363
msgid "Adding key from file"
msgstr "Ji peldankê mifte tê tevlîkirin"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:364
msgid "Updating cache"
msgstr "Pêşbîr tê rojanekirin"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:365
msgid "Removing trusted key"
msgstr "Mifteya ewledar tê rakirin"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:366
msgid "Removing packages"
msgstr "Pakêt tên rakirin"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:367
msgid "Updating packages"
msgstr "Pakêt tên rojanekirin"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:368
msgid "Upgrading system"
msgstr "Pergal tê bilindkirin"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:369 ../aptdaemon/enums.py:528
msgid "Applying changes"
msgstr "Guherandin tên bi kar anîn"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:370
msgid "Repairing incomplete installation"
msgstr "Sazkirina netemamkirî, temîr neke"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:371
msgid "Repairing installed software"
msgstr "Nivîsbariya sazkirî, temîr neke"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:372
msgid "Adding software source"
msgstr "Çavkaniya nivîsbariyê tê tevlîkirin"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:373
msgid "Enabling component of the distribution"
msgstr "Hêmana reşaneyê tê çalakkirin"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:374
msgid "Removing downloaded package files"
msgstr "Peldankên pakêtan ên daxistî tê rakirin"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:375
msgid "Reconfiguring installed packages"
msgstr "Pakêtên sazkirî dîsa eyar neke"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:376 ../aptdaemon/enums.py:517
msgid "Searching"
msgstr "Lê digere"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:380
msgid "Installation of the package file failed"
msgstr "Sazkirina peldankên pakêtan bi ser neket"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:381
msgid "Installation of software failed"
msgstr "Sazkirina nivîsbariyê bi ser neket"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:382
msgid "Adding the key to the list of trusted software vendors failed"
msgstr ""
"Tevlîkirina miftehê li lîsteya firoşkarên nivîsbariyê yên ewledar bi ser "
"neket"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:384
msgid "Refreshing the software list failed"
msgstr "Nûkirina lîsteya nivîsbariyê bi ser neket"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:385
msgid "Removing the vendor from the list of trusted ones failed"
msgstr "Rakirina firoşkar ji lîsteya ewledaran, bi ser neket"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:387
msgid "Removing software failed"
msgstr "Rakirina nivîsbariyê bi ser neket"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:388
msgid "Updating software failed"
msgstr "Rojanekirina nivîsbariyê bi ser neket"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:389
msgid "Upgrading the system failed"
msgstr "Bilindkirina pergalê bi ser neket"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:390
msgid "Applying software changes failed"
msgstr "Sepandina guhertinên nivîsbariyê bi ser neket"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:391
msgid "Repairing incomplete installation failed"
msgstr "Temîrkirina sazkirinê ya netemamkirî bi ser neket"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:393
msgid "Repairing broken dependencies failed"
msgstr "Temîrkirina bestekiyên şkestî bi ser neket"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:394
msgid "Adding software source failed"
msgstr "Tevlîkirina çavkaniya nivîsbariyê bi ser neket"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:395
msgid "Enabling component of the distribution failed"
msgstr "Çalakkirina hêmana reşaneyê bi ser neket"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:397 ../aptdaemon/enums.py:398
msgid "Removing downloaded package files failed"
msgstr "Rakirina peldankên pakêtan ên daxistî bi ser neket"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:399
msgid "Search failed"
msgstr "Lêgerîn bi ser neket"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:400
msgid "Adding license key"
msgstr "Mifteya lîsansê tê tevlîkirin"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:404 ../aptdaemon/enums.py:405
msgid "Check your Internet connection."
msgstr "Girêdana xwe ya înternetê venêre."

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:406
msgid ""
"Check if you are using third party repositories. If so disable them, since "
"they are a common source of problems.\n"
"Furthermore run the following command in a Terminal: apt-get install -f"
msgstr ""
"Venêrîn ku hûn depoyên aliyên sêyemîn bi kar tînin an na. Heke wiha be wan  "
"ji çalakiyê derxin , ji ber ku ew çavkaniyên pirsgirêkan ên berbelav in. Ji "
"xeynî wê vê fermanê li Termînalê bixebitînin: apt-get install -f"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:411
msgid "The selected file may not be a GPG key file or it might be corrupt."
msgstr ""
"Pelê hilbijartî dibe ku ne pelê mifteyan ya GPG be an jî dibe ku xerabe be."

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:413
msgid ""
"The selected key couldn't be removed. Check that you provided a valid "
"fingerprint."
msgstr ""
"Mifteya hilbijartî nebû bê rakirin. Venêrin ku we şopa tiliyê ya derbasdar "
"da ya na."

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:415
msgid ""
"Check if you are currently running another software management tool, e.g. "
"Synaptic or aptitude. Only one tool is allowed to make changes at a time."
msgstr ""
"Venêrin ku gelo nivîsbariyeke din alavên rêveberiyê bi kar tîne, w. m. "
"Synaptic an jî aptitude. Ji bo carekî tenê ji yekî alav re destûra guhertinê "
"tê dayîn."

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:418
msgid ""
"This is a serious problem. Try again later. If this problem appears again, "
"please report an error to the developers."
msgstr ""
"Ev pirsgirêkekî girîng e. Dawiyê dîsa biceribînin. Heke ev pirsgirêk dîsa "
"derkeve holê, ji kerema xwe ji pêşdebiran re çewtiyê bişînin."

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:421
msgid ""
"Check the spelling of the package name, and that the appropriate repository "
"is enabled."
msgstr "Nivîsa navê pakêtê venêrin û bira depoya lêhatî bê çalakkirin."

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:423
msgid "There isn't any need for an update."
msgstr "Tu pêwistiya rojanekirineke tune ye."

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:424
msgid "There isn't any need for an installation"
msgstr "Tu pêwistiya sazkirineke tune ye."

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:426
msgid "There isn't any need for a removal."
msgstr "Tu pêwistiya rakirineke tune ye."

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:427
msgid ""
"You requested to remove a package which is an essential part of your system."
msgstr "Te rakirina pakêtekî xwest ku yek ji perçeyên girîng ên pergalê ye"

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:430
msgid ""
"The connection to the daemon was lost. Most likely the background daemon "
"crashed."
msgstr "Girêdana daemon-ê winda bû. Muhtemel e ku deamon-a paşzemîn têk çû."

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:432
msgid "The installation or removal of a software package failed."
msgstr "Daxistin an jî rakirina pakêteke nivîsbariyê bi ser neket."

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:434
msgid "The requested feature is not supported."
msgstr "Taybetmendiya ku tu dixwazî ne piştgirîdar e."

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:435
msgid ""
"There seems to be a programming error in aptdaemon, the software that allows "
"you to install/remove software and to perform other package management "
"related tasks."
msgstr ""
"Xuya dibe ku li aptdaemon-ê çewtiyeke bernamekirinê heye û ev derfeta "
"sazkirin/rakirina nivîsbariyê û pêkanîna peywirên têkilî rêveberiya pakêtan "
"dide we."

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:439
msgid ""
"This error could be caused by required additional software packages which "
"are missing or not installable. Furthermore there could be a conflict "
"between software packages which are not allowed to be installed at the same "
"time."
msgstr ""
"Ev çewtî dibe ku ji ber pakêtên nivîsbariyê yên zêdek in, ên ku nabe "
"sazkirin an jî kêm in. Û, dibe ku di navbera pakêtên nivîsbariyê de yên ku "
"destûra daxistinê naye dayîn, nakokiyeke heye."

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:445
msgid "This requires installing packages from unauthenticated sources."
msgstr ""
"Ev pêwistiya sazkirina pakêtan dike yên ku ji çavkaniyên nepiştrastkirî ne."

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:447
msgid ""
"The installation could have failed because of an error in the corresponding "
"software package or it was cancelled in an unfriendly way. You have to "
"repair this before you can install or remove any further software."
msgstr ""
"Sazkirin, mimkun e ku ji ber çewtiyeke pakêta nivîsbariyê ya têkilî bi ser "
"neket an jî bi şêweya nedostanî hat betalkirin. Ji bo sazkirin an jî "
"rakirina nivîsbariyeke din divê tu wê temîr bikî."

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:453
msgid ""
"Please copy the file to your local computer and check the file permissions."
msgstr ""
"Ji kerema xwe peldankan li kombersa xwe ya herêmî kopî bike û destûrên "
"peldankan venêre."

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:456
msgid ""
"The installation of a package which violates the quality standards isn't "
"allowed. This could cause serious problems on your computer. Please contact "
"the person or organisation who provided this package file and include the "
"details beneath."
msgstr ""
"Ji sazkirina pakêteke re ya ku standardên qalîteyê xira dike, destûrê nayê "
"dayîn. Ev, mimkun e ku bibe sebeba pirsgirêkên girîng di kombersa te de."

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:463
msgid ""
"The downloaded license key which is required to run this piece of software "
"is not valid or could not be installed correctly.\n"
"See the details for more information."
msgstr ""
"Mifteya lîsansê ya ku ji bo xebitandina vê beşa nivîsbariyê hate daxisti,n "
"ne derbasdar e an jî baş nehat sazkirin. Ji bo agahiyên zêdetir li "
"hûragahiyan binêre."

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:469
msgid "All available upgrades have already been installed."
msgstr "Hemû bilindkirinên heyî, berê hatiye sazkirin."

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:471
msgid ""
"The license key which allows you to use this piece of software could not be "
"downloaded. Please check your network connection."
msgstr ""
"Mifteya lîsansê ya ku ji bo bikaranînê destûrê ji we re dide, nehat "
"daxistin. Ji kerema xwe li girêdana xwe ya torê venêre."

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:475
msgid "You don't have the required privileges to perform this action."
msgstr "Ji bo pêkanîna vê çalakiyê, tu ne xwediyê mafên pêdivî ne."

#: ../aptdaemon/enums.py:477
msgid ""
"You either provided a wrong password or cancelled the authorization.\n"
"Furthermore there could also be a technical reason for this error if you "
"haven't seen a password dialog: your desktop environment doesn't provide a "
"PolicyKit session agent."
msgstr ""
"Ya te şîfreyeke çewt daye yan jî te destûrê betal kiriye. \n"
"Û, heke te qûtîkeke ragihandinê ya şîfreyê nedîtibe, dibe ku sebeba vê "
"çewtiyê teknîkî be: derdora sermaseya te navgîneke danîşînê ya PolicyKit-ê "
"temîn nake."

